                "description": "The Myles Lever with Disk Rosette is great for modern spaces. This stunning new leverset from Emtek combines contemporary design and chic finishes. The Myles Lever with Modern Disk Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Modern Myles Leverset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
